  "answer": "The Atlas Logistics pilot achieved all targeted benchmarks [NL-020#NL-020-S04]. Measured results show Weekly Active Usage at 87.5% (target >75%), Query Success at 84.2% (>80%), Citation Accuracy at 88.6% (>85%), Median Onboarding at 4.8 weeks (target 5 weeks), Support Escalation Decline of 18.4% (>15%), and Average Query Latency at 1.8 seconds (<2.0s) [NL-020#NL-020-S04]. Key lessons learned include making pre-ingestion document cleanup mandatory, keeping permissions simple using broad department-level folders, and prioritizing mobile-friendly UI and messaging integrations for frontline staff [NL-020#NL-020-S07]. The expansion recommendation involves a phased rollout [NL-020#NL-020-S08]: Phase 1 expands to 500 users across the Chicago, Dallas, and Atlanta offices in Q3 2026 with a $2,500 onboarding fee and training webinars by Lina Park [NL-020#NL-020-S08]; Phase 2 implements advanced OCR ingestion in August 2026 [NL-020#NL-020-S08]; Phase 3 transitions to the Enterprise Plan ($8,500/month) with Microsoft Teams integration in Q4 2026 if the user count exceeds 2,000 [NL-020#NL-020-S08]; and Phase 4 (Q1 2027) builds an automated REST API pipeline with query audit scripts and quarterly compliance reports [NL-020#NL-020-S08].\n\nANSWER_STATUS: answer\nUSED_MEMORY_CLAIMS: none",
